{"meta":{"id":"db-schema","category":"aide/common-rules","title":"DB 스키마 변경","subtitle":"","summary":"참조 검색 범위, DDL·COMMENT·코드·문서 한 묶음, 옛→새 테이블 전환 순서, 영향 행 수·실제 조회로 저장 확인","tags":["aide","규칙","db"],"color":"indigo","watermarkClass":"watermark-bg-blog-indigo","source":"aide_agents/1-rules","updatedAt":"2026-10-18"},"html":"<div class=\"absolute -top-12 -right-12 w-48 h-48 bg-indigo-200/40 rounded-full blur-3xl opacity-70 pointer-events-none\"></div>\r\n<div class=\"relative pb-5 border-b border-indigo-200/70\">\r\n<div class=\"flex items-center justify-between mb-2.5\">\r\n<span class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-semibold bg-indigo-50 text-indigo-700 border border-indigo-300/60 tracking-wider\"><span class=\"w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-indigo-500\"></span>1-rules</span>\r\n<span class=\"text-[11px] font-medium tracking-wide text-stone-400 font-serif\">2026-10-18</span>\r\n</div>\r\n<h1 class=\"text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-tight leading-snug\">DB 스키마 변경</h1>\r\n<div class=\"mt-3 flex items-start gap-2 bg-indigo-50/70 border border-indigo-200/60 rounded-xl p-3\"><svg class=\"w-4 h-4 text-indigo-600 shrink-0 mt-0.5\" fill=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M10 18a8 8 0 100-16 8 8 0 000 16zm3.707-9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414-1.414L9 10.586 7.707 9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414 1.414l2 2a1 1 0 001.414 0l4-4z\" clip-rule=\"evenodd\"></path></svg><p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-700 leading-relaxed font-medium\"><strong class=\"text-stone-900\">요약:</strong> 참조 검색 범위, DDL·COMMENT·코드·문서 한 묶음, 옛→새 테이블 전환 순서, 영향 행 수·실제 조회로 저장 확인</p></div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"py-5 border-t border-stone-100\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-3\"><div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-indigo-500\"></div><h2 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-wide\">원칙</h2></div><div class=\"space-y-2 text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-600 pl-1\"><div class=\"tip-bullet-row\"><span class=\"tip-bullet-dot text-indigo-400\">•</span><span class=\"tip-bullet-content\"><strong class=\"font-bold text-stone-900\">이름을 바꾸기 전에 참조하는 곳을 전부 찾는다</strong> — DB 이름은 매퍼·코드 문자열·화면 키·프롬프트에 흩어져 컴파일 에러로 안 드러난다</span></div><div class=\"tip-bullet-row\"><span class=\"tip-bullet-dot text-indigo-400\">•</span><span class=\"tip-bullet-content\"><strong class=\"font-bold text-stone-900\">DDL · COMMENT · 코드 · 문서는 한 묶음으로</strong> 바꾼다</span></div><div class=\"tip-bullet-row\"><span class=\"tip-bullet-dot text-indigo-400\">•</span><span class=\"tip-bullet-content\"><strong class=\"font-bold text-stone-900\">같은 개념은 모든 테이블에서 같은 이름</strong></span></div><div class=\"tip-bullet-row\"><span class=\"tip-bullet-dot text-indigo-400\">•</span><span class=\"tip-bullet-content\"><strong class=\"font-bold text-stone-900\">저장 실패를 숨기지 않는다</strong> — 예외를 삼키거나 영향 행 수를 안 보면 &quot;왜 저장이 안 됐지&quot;를 나중에 찾게 된다</span></div><div class=\"tip-bullet-row\"><span class=\"tip-bullet-dot text-indigo-400\">•</span><span class=\"tip-bullet-content\"><strong class=\"font-bold text-stone-900\">운영 DB 변경 전 되돌리는 방법</strong>(되돌리는 DDL, 백업)을 먼저 준비</span></div></div></div>\r\n<div class=\"py-5 border-t border-stone-100\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-3\"><div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-indigo-500\"></div><h2 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-wide\">참조 검색 범위</h2></div><p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-600 leading-relaxed\">옛 이름으로 아래를 모두 검색하고, 결과 목록을 사용자에게 보여준 뒤 진행한다.</p><div class=\"border border-stone-200 rounded-2xl overflow-x-auto bg-white\"><table class=\"w-full text-left text-xs sm:text-[13px]\"><thead><tr class=\"bg-stone-50 border-b border-stone-200 text-stone-600 font-semibold\"><th class=\"py-2 px-3 whitespace-nowrap\">범위</th><th class=\"py-2 px-3 whitespace-nowrap\">놓치기 쉬운 이유</th></tr></thead><tbody class=\"divide-y divide-stone-100\"><tr class=\"hover:bg-indigo-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\">SQL 파일, 매퍼 XML</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">동적 SQL·<code class='font-mono text-[12px] bg-stone-200/60 px-1 rounded'>&lt;include&gt;</code> 조각 안에 있다</td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-indigo-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\">코드 안 문자열(Java·Python)</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">쿼리를 문자열로 조립하면 IDE 참조 검색에 안 걸린다</td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-indigo-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\">JSP·JS</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">컬럼명이 그대로 화면 키(JSON 필드)로 쓰인다</td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-indigo-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\">뷰·프로시저·트리거</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">코드 저장소 밖 DB 안에만 있다 — <code class='font-mono text-[12px] bg-stone-200/60 px-1 rounded'>information_schema</code>로 조회</td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-indigo-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\">AI 프롬프트·설정 JSON</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">컬럼명을 프롬프트에 넣어 AI가 쓰게 한 경우</td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-indigo-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\">문서(README, 설계, DDL 파일)</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">코드가 아니라 검색에서 빼기 쉽다</td></tr></tbody></table></div></div>\r\n<div class=\"py-5 border-t border-stone-100\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-3\"><div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-indigo-500\"></div><h2 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-wide\">변경 종류별 확인</h2></div><div class=\"border border-stone-200 rounded-2xl overflow-x-auto bg-white\"><table class=\"w-full text-left text-xs sm:text-[13px]\"><thead><tr class=\"bg-stone-50 border-b border-stone-200 text-stone-600 font-semibold\"><th class=\"py-2 px-3 whitespace-nowrap\">변경</th><th class=\"py-2 px-3 whitespace-nowrap\">확인할 것</th></tr></thead><tbody class=\"divide-y divide-stone-100\"><tr class=\"hover:bg-indigo-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\">컬럼 추가</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">기본값·NULL 허용(기존 행), 컬럼 목록 생략한 <code class='font-mono text-[12px] bg-stone-200/60 px-1 rounded'>INSERT</code>, <code class='font-mono text-[12px] bg-stone-200/60 px-1 rounded'>SELECT *</code>로 받는 화면</td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-indigo-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\">이름 변경</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">참조 검색 전체 + 화면 키가 바뀌는지(바뀌면 프론트도)</td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-indigo-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\">타입·길이 변경</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">기존 데이터가 새 타입에 맞는지 먼저 조회(잘림·변환 실패)</td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-indigo-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\">삭제</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">참조 0건 확인 후. 바로 지우지 않고 사용을 끊고 한동안 둔다</td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-indigo-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\">테이블 교체</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">아래 전환 순서</td></tr></tbody></table></div></div>\r\n<div class=\"py-5 border-t border-stone-100\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-3\"><div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-indigo-500\"></div><h2 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-wide\">전환 순서 (옛 테이블 → 새 테이블)</h2></div><div class=\"space-y-2 text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-600 pl-1\"><div class=\"tip-bullet-row\"><span class=\"tip-bullet-dot text-indigo-400\">•</span><span class=\"tip-bullet-content\">1. 새 구조 추가(옛 것은 그대로)</span></div><div class=\"tip-bullet-row\"><span class=\"tip-bullet-dot text-indigo-400\">•</span><span class=\"tip-bullet-content\">2. 데이터 복사 → 건수·샘플 비교</span></div><div class=\"tip-bullet-row\"><span class=\"tip-bullet-dot text-indigo-400\">•</span><span class=\"tip-bullet-content\">3. <strong class=\"font-bold text-stone-900\">읽기</strong>를 새 쪽으로 → 화면·결과 확인</span></div><div class=\"tip-bullet-row\"><span class=\"tip-bullet-dot text-indigo-400\">•</span><span class=\"tip-bullet-content\">4. <strong class=\"font-bold text-stone-900\">쓰기</strong>를 새 쪽으로 → 저장 확인</span></div><div class=\"tip-bullet-row\"><span class=\"tip-bullet-dot text-indigo-400\">•</span><span class=\"tip-bullet-content\">5. 옛 테이블 참조 0건이면 사용자 확인 후 제거 — 단계마다 커밋</span></div></div></div>\r\n<div class=\"py-5 border-t border-stone-100\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-3\"><div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-indigo-500\"></div><h2 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-wide\">저장 확인</h2></div><div class=\"space-y-2 text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-600 pl-1\"><div class=\"tip-bullet-row\"><span class=\"tip-bullet-dot text-indigo-400\">•</span><span class=\"tip-bullet-content\"><code class='font-mono text-[12px] bg-stone-200/60 px-1 rounded'>INSERT</code>/<code class='font-mono text-[12px] bg-stone-200/60 px-1 rounded'>UPDATE</code>/<code class='font-mono text-[12px] bg-stone-200/60 px-1 rounded'>DELETE</code> 뒤 <strong class=\"font-bold text-stone-900\">영향 행 수</strong> 확인, 0건이면 WARNING 이상 로그 또는 실패 처리</span></div><div class=\"tip-bullet-row\"><span class=\"tip-bullet-dot text-indigo-400\">•</span><span class=\"tip-bullet-content\">트랜잭션 커밋 위치 확인(autocommit 꺼짐, 예외 시 롤백만 되고 로그 없는 경우)</span></div><div class=\"tip-bullet-row\"><span class=\"tip-bullet-dot text-indigo-400\">•</span><span class=\"tip-bullet-content\"><code class='font-mono text-[12px] bg-stone-200/60 px-1 rounded'>catch</code>에서 예외를 삼키지 않는다</span></div><div class=\"tip-bullet-row\"><span class=\"tip-bullet-dot text-indigo-400\">•</span><span class=\"tip-bullet-content\">저장 확인은 코드가 아니라 <strong class=\"font-bold text-stone-900\">DB를 직접 조회</strong>해서 끝낸다</span></div></div></div>\r\n<div class=\"py-5 border-t border-stone-100\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-3\"><div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-indigo-500\"></div><h2 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-wide\">AI 행동</h2></div><div class=\"space-y-2 text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-600 pl-1\"><div class=\"tip-bullet-row\"><span class=\"tip-bullet-dot text-indigo-400\">•</span><span class=\"tip-bullet-content\">이름 변경·삭제 요청이면 수정 전에 참조 검색 결과를 먼저 보여준다</span></div><div class=\"tip-bullet-row\"><span class=\"tip-bullet-dot text-indigo-400\">•</span><span class=\"tip-bullet-content\">DDL만 바꾸라는 요청이어도 같이 바뀌어야 할 COMMENT·코드·문서를 보고</span></div><div class=\"tip-bullet-row\"><span class=\"tip-bullet-dot text-indigo-400\">•</span><span class=\"tip-bullet-content\">운영 DB에 DDL·대량 UPDATE 전에는 대상·예상 건수·되돌리는 방법을 보여주고 묻는다</span></div><div class=\"tip-bullet-row\"><span class=\"tip-bullet-dot text-indigo-400\">•</span><span class=\"tip-bullet-content\">저장 코드를 고친 뒤 DB를 조회해 실제 저장을 확인하고 결과를 보여준다</span></div></div></div>\r\n<div class=\"py-5 border-t border-stone-100\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-3\"><div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-indigo-500\"></div><h2 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-wide\">체크리스트</h2></div><div class=\"space-y-2 text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-600 pl-1\"><div class=\"tip-bullet-row\"><span class=\"tip-bullet-dot text-indigo-400\">•</span><span class=\"tip-bullet-content\">☐ 옛 이름으로 참조 검색 범위 전체를 찾았는가</span></div><div class=\"tip-bullet-row\"><span class=\"tip-bullet-dot text-indigo-400\">•</span><span class=\"tip-bullet-content\">☐ DDL · COMMENT · 코드 · 문서를 같이 바꿨는가</span></div><div class=\"tip-bullet-row\"><span class=\"tip-bullet-dot text-indigo-400\">•</span><span class=\"tip-bullet-content\">☐ 테이블 교체는 읽기 → 쓰기 순서로 단계마다 확인·커밋했는가</span></div><div class=\"tip-bullet-row\"><span class=\"tip-bullet-dot text-indigo-400\">•</span><span class=\"tip-bullet-content\">☐ 저장 후 영향 행 수와 실제 DB 조회로 확인했는가, 되돌리는 DDL·백업이 있는가</span></div></div></div>\r\n","path":"aide/common-rules/db-schema","breadcrumb":[{"id":"root","title":"Home","path":""},{"id":"aide","title":"aide","path":"aide"},{"id":"common-rules","title":"1-rules (공통 규칙)","path":"aide/common-rules"}],"hasImage":false}